    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1728882648153\" id=\"item-670ca615a6e64a4406f01af4\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-video video-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/34418.js&quot;,&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.video/34a613e1-1219-44af-8e10-2e3cccacdd21_736/website.components.video.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.video\" data-sqsp-block=\"video\" data-website-component-id=\"yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  <div class=\"intrinsic\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n    <div class=\"embed-block-wrapper\">\n      <div\n        class=\"sqs-native-video\"\n        data-config-settings=\"\"\n        data-config-video=\"{&quot;systemDataSourceType&quot;:&quot;mp4&quot;,&quot;alexandriaUrl&quot;:&quot;https://video.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/43f1a776-bc18-450f-b457-70c3c5390062/{variant}&quot;,&quot;durationSeconds&quot;:113.36325,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:1.7777777777777777,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;670ca6f38ef4f83c4d7d785d&quot;,&quot;systemDataVariants&quot;:&quot;1920:1080,640:360&quot;,&quot;alexandriaLibraryId&quot;:&quot;66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32&quot;,&quot;audioCodec&quot;:&quot;aac&quot;,&quot;systemDataId&quot;:&quot;43f1a776-bc18-450f-b457-70c3c5390062&quot;,&quot;videoCodec&quot;:&quot;h264&quot;}\"\n        data-config-loading=\"\"\n        \n      >\n        <div\n          class=\"native-video-player\"\n          style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;\"\n        >\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n  \n  \n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 .intrinsic {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-video-block-blend);\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-video-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  \n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 .intrinsic {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n  <style>#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 { border-width: 0; height: auto; }</style>\n  \n  \n  \n    <style>\n    \n      \n    \n      \n        @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 { background-color: transparent; }\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77069 .intrinsic { background-color: var(--tweak-video-block-background-color); }\n        }\n      \n    \n    </style>\n  \n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-7935f1d4d9b9a1d8d65a\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Property Media Japan specialises in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floor-plans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan.</p><p class=\"\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Located at 12 Fletcher Way, this charming three-bedroom, two-bathroom home combines modern comfort with serene outdoor living. Built on a spacious plot, this property offers ample room both inside and out, making it an ideal setting for a family or holiday retreat.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Interior Features:</strong><br>Step into a welcoming open-plan living area, where natural light floods through large windows, highlighting the plush furnishings and contemporary decor. The kitchen, equipped with state-of-the-art appliances and a large countertop, is perfect for entertaining guests or preparing family meals. Each of the three bedrooms is well-appointed, offering peace and privacy, complemented by two modern bathrooms that provide a spa-like experience.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Exterior Features:</strong><br>Outside, the home features a beautifully maintained garden and a comfortable patio area complete with outdoor furniture, perfect for dining al fresco or enjoying the tranquil surroundings. A compact yet functional garage provides secure parking for one vehicle.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Additional Amenities:</strong><br>Residents will enjoy the practicality of a dedicated laundry room, complete with modern appliances, ensuring all domestic needs are met with ease.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Location:</strong><br>Nestled in a picturesque neighborhood of Niseko, known for its stunning landscapes and exceptional recreational activities, this home is conveniently located near ski resorts, hiking trails, and local amenities, offering a perfect balance of adventure and tranquility.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This property is not just a house, but a gateway to a lifestyle of comfort, activity, and relaxation in one of Japan's most sought-after locations. Whether as a permanent residence or a holiday home, it promises to be a place where memories are made.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-0 span-0\"></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;670ca756d7cfb90ecbf63175&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;670ca756d7cfb90ecbf63175&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1728878763848_77980\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"670ca7a37877ec117cf3d59d\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1728882620166-UOOQ342LQ8B864N448NI/12+Fletcher+Way%2C+Arrow